Z||000000||p4n1c||05-18-2001||10:29 AM||||Anyone have any experience with re-chroming badging?  The badging on my car is pretty crappy, the chrome has come off and they are just brown messes.<P>Is it just a paint or a specific process to get it to work properly?<P>Thanks<P>------------------<BR>-=-=-=[ p4n1c ]=-=-=-<BR>1988 Olds Cutlass Supreme International<BR>2.8L MPFI V6/TH440-T4 OD auto<BR>"Ride the geriatric mobile.. err..  rocket"||||reg||1
